articles.content_en:
1. For the following labor dispute cases, where one or both parties refuse to accept the arbitration decision of the labor dispute arbitration commission and initiate a prosecution in the People's Court within 15 days from the date of receipt of the written arbitration decision, if the conditions for prosecution stipulated in Article 81 of the Civil Procedure Law of the People's Republic of China (for Trial Implementation) are satisfied, the People's Court shall accept the case:
1. Labor dispute cases as specified in Articles 2, 30 and 32 of the Interim Provisions of the State Council on the Handling of Labor Disputes in State-owned Enterprises;
2. Labor dispute cases as specified in Article 29 of the Interim Regulations of the State Council on Private Enterprises;
3. Labor dispute cases that shall be tried by the People's Court pursuant to other laws and regulations.
